msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But beyond that,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas além disso,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e3f79f78a5e18bdfa8523a8c469163a2ee7ecceb71569f3caa797b4365086b0
#. default-sha256: 08febad425acaf6e3366441a5b7f8478669f6dc09ec4bf1e7a6c509af6e23fc2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can only clearly remember the last five years or so of my life.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In my oldest "
"real memory, I was a slave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Só consigo me lembrar claramente dos últimos cinco anos da minha vida.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Na "
"minha lembrança real mais antiga, eu era um escravo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1108311517277d0121b5ed9ecf9a5ae32f18fbe9fc122c2b40a0ac168e8294e
#. default-sha256: cf5add4203f7a562dbec4a84e7faf9c84c94baab667a6aae5e4045293aadda32
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You have no idea what that’s like.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How it feels to be abused and humiliated,⟪k:3⟫"
"desperate for food and water."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você não tem ideia de como é isso.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Como é ser abusado e humilhado,⟪k:3⟫desesperado "
"por comida e água."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b9f8d75f62b5d1d34cdaea555a1404660e3c805b3de71149e03fb9868d894a8
#. default-sha256: 23f228be6d2686ae6b58b64f31f922942e644b90aedc59d9f06aff8db3a641e4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh... ⟪k:1⟫I see.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So as I was saying..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫Entendo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Então, como eu estava dizendo..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 027573ca28b9cb7771224b4c4cc884a812329869ebcdc1f2e96ea9a9895e1893
#. default-sha256: 61334b44a6f932a6ed15974a6067fe6549aff8f1daffd2c99a7d01a2be2b5b04
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But they were right about what I was deep down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a beast—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and my revenge "
"went far beyond what could be considered reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas eles estavam certos sobre o que eu era no fundo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫uma besta—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e minha "
"vingança foi muito além do que poderia ser considerado razoável."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 917dd375568806bd3f30d2e10a77c22ca53b168d59d270df7cd5d4de33727949
#. default-sha256: 7eb7651321e9c7cddb779b3f98ad93f893fcf47c601ed700a09f4194d5b8ad4c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Four years ago,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quatro anos atrás,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 373717926992eab2ff5a4e513753a0facf29b9ce71d3a7076f4502638cf493e6
#. default-sha256: d5529866a699be657fd459a94830fa26fb7a5fec0eb44491b7c8d3e0186c063f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sitting in a carriage as it rattled along a dirt road. ⟪k:1⟫This was not the kind of "
"carriage you rode around town in, but a filthy slave transport."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫eu estava sentado em uma carruagem enquanto ela chacoalhava ao longo de uma estrada de "
"terra. ⟪k:1⟫Esse não era o tipo de carruagem em que você andava pela cidade, mas um transporte de "
"escravos imundo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7adb30c941d679c5ce1d0784eb8b484a9e97ce372966374b8ad77bf6a355d2ae
#. default-sha256: a8faf1739bbadc413eb17145bdf635f4f0dc2e018595946635ce4d6faf15c1ca
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were men, young women, and even children.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everyone wore a look of "
"hopelessness on their faces,⟪k:3⟫and no one had the strength left to resist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia homens, mulheres jovens e até crianças.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Todos tinham uma expressão de "
"desespero no rosto,⟪k:3⟫e ninguém tinha mais forças para resistir."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D886E58_66E2_49FB_9D60_309E65564CB9
