msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9BDA91B8_539C_4F5D_847A_7DA133F4322E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her response perplexed me to no end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A resposta dela me deixou completamente perplexo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EC49C8BB_5FDB_4AE8_9EBB_AA9063A1CF4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fbd09da60999b9b5fec539ef63ae4b0041a91ca6f7b9f7b5dfcc02e535a68c4
#. default-sha256: 018880205d7a1d6d997de547aee1e6790131727874edcc1ff2f21348e9a23db0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EC49C8BB_5FDB_4AE8_9EBB_AA9063A1CF4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why was she concerned about showing gratitude?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why was she not despairing of her "
"own circumstances?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por que ela estava preocupada em demonstrar gratidão?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por que ela não estava se "
"desesperando com suas próprias circunstâncias?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_588F204E_BD55_492F_AE46_FEE88E4B0992
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47989c3e9d89033c13b071dd6f3cab54019fee9dac2f5df3e8c85bcf0dd72e0b
#. default-sha256: ce7174745dd85c782c861c941e07ec1080c5996b50c5dce6a72b22038276d5ab
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_588F204E_BD55_492F_AE46_FEE88E4B0992"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why was ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ the emotion that gripped her in that moment,⟪k:3⟫not hatred for the "
"slave trader or sorrow for herself?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por que foi essa a emoção que a dominou naquele momento,⟪k:1⟫não ódio pelo traficante de "
"escravos ou tristeza por si mesma?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E741F2EC_7327_47BE_A7F8_6829F55F4BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ef78e48d1ce7dc19c4f2aaaec9c086de580a3dec775da208bbb64ca9dd4f527
#. default-sha256: f5fd758646b9da93747f7669ebc9c9356c8f9ac66737ffb2f2103bbe84b52d22
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E741F2EC_7327_47BE_A7F8_6829F55F4BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t the only thing I found curious—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas não foi só isso que achei curioso—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5208504F_1AAE_4F72_B6CB_E7190415914C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b2a20e757170e2989b6d877fb27747b6af096348c79c2d37821330a72d23344
#. default-sha256: 14f38a4b5cf0bc263762f3fab0a5880666d4504ae584792bf53ffad551c1f1c7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5208504F_1AAE_4F72_B6CB_E7190415914C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫untainted by its surroundings, gently undulating."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫não contaminado pelo ambiente, suavemente ondulando."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E504084A_9C20_45F3_912C_A7D0B10F5E4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8750dc6e00805d8b388a6983b45ce2343c2a698ad668d9e4bdd8642565501285
#. default-sha256: 42e2953af40014344d31b063a8b8dc86b10c0544dc720f78214e30e797d2bb69
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E504084A_9C20_45F3_912C_A7D0B10F5E4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One sentence was all she said, but there was something unbelievably calming about the sound "
"of it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Uma frase foi tudo o que ela disse, mas havia algo incrivelmente calmante no som dela."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B8A4CC39_B636_4246_8280_80E8593A0BC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21ae293d1ac5fc0da5bdf224b2f888b243a3486426f6a9ee0fbb2078eb92dedd
#. default-sha256: 1f50ffbd947c848b3512e3210eee7c264fb18b7ff3bafad96424b8fb434296fd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B8A4CC39_B636_4246_8280_80E8593A0BC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to get her out of that filthy carriage,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to undo the shackles threatening "
"to taint her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫eu queria tirá-la daquela carruagem imunda,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫desfazer os grilhões que ameaçavam "
"contaminá-la."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C67B8C_AC73_47DE_B7BA_2A35F735CC4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78baae8d0b568876c8c496340a6c76590e433352aeb6fbcd78bd7a80a49b278d
#. default-sha256: 0d2999405f5dd30b043cf8ba75fd24c96adb8f285585a0b23be43e7e2d9053ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C67B8C_AC73_47DE_B7BA_2A35F735CC4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please! Y-⟪k:1⟫You can have all my money!⟪k:2⟫You can go free, if that’s what you want!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por favor! V-⟪k:1⟫Você pode ficar com todo o meu dinheiro!⟪k:2⟫Você pode ficar livre, se é "
"isso que quer!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9304167_6DA8_4048_B3A9_C40F51B84193
