#: scenario8:scenario8_7DBA9456_045C_4B81_80D9_855C84B146AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 762aa51e042d69c6a1aa42957dd54e9af072251fe19aae53015ccf96e11e0fa2
#. default-sha256: 5de9034a8cbe55ce4454ac07b7f3edabe3b6803cfe87124ce1d5573d792691fd
