msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If doing so would give her peace—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and if I could be a part of that peace—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"then I wanted to grant her wish."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se fazer isso lhe daria paz—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e se eu pudesse fazer parte dessa paz—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫então "
"eu queria realizar o desejo dela."

