msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Explain something to me, lord.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said that if I helped you, the nun would be able "
"to save more people than she does now. ⟪k:3⟫So how does capturing this witch accomplish that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Explique-me uma coisa, lorde.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você disse que se eu te ajudasse, a freira seria "
"capaz de salvar mais pessoas do que ela salva agora. ⟪k:3⟫Então como capturar essa bruxa realiza "
"isso?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_995AE10E_06EB_49DC_9F2C_EFDC0AD5B608
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f759a2706249dc03fc6e6cfeb2df6cbc2f713455a8d7a8a12102b271b7b96243
