"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Selling” isn’t quite the right word, but if that’s how you want to think of it, by all "
"means."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Vender” não é bem a palavra certa, mas se é assim que você quer pensar, vá em frente."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CB719C18_A0B8_4822_B262_1D5E2F25C1D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bd3cf230e518d0ae590e2c30d0b6dcdcad53cd7e5b10b59b46cd3d81a68d3d3
