msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A single witch’s freedom is all it’ll cost for everyone here to come out happy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A liberdade de uma única bruxa é tudo o que custará para que todos aqui saiam felizes."

#: scenario8:scenario8_60840E14_2AF3_4F9F_8D76_E17EC9638A56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a4e79b839c28bc482af2609ed1b8102d317b858acb4a2eaf95935dd474e7c59
