msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I thought you’d hesitate at least a ⟪k:2⟫little⟪k:3⟫, but I guess it was foolish of me "
"to presume to understand how a killer’s mind works."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Achei que você hesitaria pelo menos um ⟪k:2⟫pouco⟪k:3⟫, mas acho que foi tolice da "
"minha parte presumir entender como funciona a mente de um assassino."

#: scenario8:scenario8_18E27137_B63B_481B_B512_8DD975427206
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48c5e6f32f2c3c566b682ee8c1763182d6d5c2c321523d457b1fed5807a4013f
